# Directory Structure Rules

This document defines the rules for the directory structure of the project. Please follow these rules strictly to maintain consistency and readability.

## Basic Rules

- Directory names should be concise and descriptive.
- Use lowercase letters and underscores (`_`) for directory names.
- Avoid using spaces or special characters in directory names.

## Directory Structure Example
